@startuml
title System Context diagram for Currency Telegram Bot
left to right direction

actor "Telegram user\n<<Person>>\nRequests a currency code such as EUR." as user
rectangle "Currency Telegram Bot\n<<Software System>>\nReturns the value of 1 USD in a requested currency." as bot
rectangle "Telegram Bot API\n<<External Software System>>\nDelivers updates and sends bot messages." as telegram
rectangle "Frankfurter API\n<<External Software System>>\nProvides exchange rates based on USD." as frankfurter

user --> telegram : Sends a currency code\nTelegram client protocol
telegram --> bot : Delivers update\nHTTPS webhook
bot --> telegram : Sends rate reply\nHTTPS Bot API
bot --> frankfurter : Requests USD exchange rate\nHTTPS JSON API

legend right
  <<Person>> = human user
  <<Software System>> = system in scope
  <<External Software System>> = external dependency
endlegend
@enduml
